WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.800
I want to begin in Volume 4 or continue in Volume 4 with November 21st, 1902.

2
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.520
As I was neither, as I could neither lose consciousness nor sleep, Louisa said, my poor

3
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.960
nature could take no more.

4
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:27.280
But then when I felt convinced more than ever that I would not see Jesus anymore, all of

5
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:34.200
a sudden he came and he made me lose consciousness, which of course means going to ecstasy.

6
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.720
I was as though struck by lightning.

7
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.080
Who can say my fear?

8
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.520
I had no control over myself.

9
00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:44.160
It was no longer in my power to regain consciousness.

10
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.960
So she was taken suddenly into ecstasy.

11
00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:50.240
This has happened to other saints as well.

12
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:59.440
And people feel a lot of fear because, as Louisa says here, you feel you're out of control.

13
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:02.000
Jesus told me, my daughter do not fear.

14
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.800
I have come to strengthen you.

15
00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:08.600
That's give you the gift of fortitude.

16
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:13.640
Don't you yourself see that you can take no more and that your nature fails without me?

17
00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:18.160
Well, that's John 15.5, without me you can do nothing.

18
00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:25.240
And Philippians 4.13, with the Lord I can do all things.

19
00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:29.480
And Louisa said to him, am I life without you, I am dead.

20
00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:31.760
I feel no more vital strength.

21
00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:34.240
You used to form my whole being.

22
00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:37.080
And if I do not have you, I lack everything.

23
00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:41.800
Indeed, if you continue not coming, I will die of sorrow.

24
00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:48.280
That's the song of songs, chapter 5 verse 6, and my soul failed at his flight.

25
00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:50.840
I saw him, but I did not find him.

26
00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:54.200
I called to him, but he did not answer.

27
00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:59.920
It's the weeping of the lover for her beloved.

28
00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:04.120
And he said, my beloved daughter, you say that I am your life.

29
00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:11.920
And I say to you that you are my living life, that's John 14, 20, 21, you and me, and I

30
00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:16.360
in you both completely won.

31
00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.240
You are my living life.

32
00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:25.360
Just as I made use of my humanity to suffer, so I am using your humanity to continue the

33
00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:27.160
course of my sufferings.

34
00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:33.840
Just Colossians 1, 24, it makes her a co-redeemer.

35
00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:39.120
I'm using your nature to continue the course of my sufferings within you.

36
00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:42.600
Therefore, you are all mine.

37
00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:49.440
Even more, you are my very life, 1 Corinthians 3, 16.

38
00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:58.080
No, you are the temple of the living God and the Holy Spirit dwells within you.

39
00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:07.040
As he was saying this, I remembered the obedience of the priest, and I said to him, Louisa said,

40
00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:13.320
my sweet good, will you let me obey by allowing me to come round by myself?

41
00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:21.480
And Jesus said, my daughter, I, the creator, have obeyed the creature that is the priest.

42
00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:26.440
By keeping you suspended in these days, it's only right now for the creature that is the

43
00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:32.080
priest to obey his creator by submitting to my will.

44
00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:36.760
Because before my divine will, the human reason does not count.

45
00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:41.960
And the strongest reason before the supreme will resolves into smoke.

46
00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:45.160
That's Romans 11, 33 to 36.

47
00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:50.880
So here Jesus is demanding that the priests will acknowledge that it truly is him that

48
00:03:50.880 --> 00:04:00.040
is operating in Louisa, and that it is his divine will that they are actually opposing.

49
00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:05.680
So Louisa said, who can say how embittered I felt, but I was resigned, making a vow to

50
00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:08.840
the Lord never to withdraw my will from his.

51
00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:13.680
Now there's a very important stage, we're still in volume four.

52
00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:17.840
And it's not until you get to volume 11 that the full revelation of the divine will will

53
00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:24.280
be made, but Louisa will already be deeply committed to the divine will long before then.

54
00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:30.560
And here she takes a vow never to withdraw her will from the divine will.

55
00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:34.200
Not even, she said, for the blink of an eye.

56
00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:39.440
And since they that's the priests had told me that if I was surprised by that state and

57
00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:42.720
would not come round by myself, they would let me die.

58
00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:48.520
That's not going to be a problem for Louisa, she's been wanting to die all the time.

59
00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:56.120
So because of that, I was preparing myself for death considering it a great, great fortune.

60
00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:58.960
And I prayed the Lord to take me in his arms.

61
00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:02.960
The while I was doing this, the confessor came to make me come round, embittering me

62
00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.760
even more.

63
00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:11.480
So much so that seeing me so embittered, the Lord told me in my interior, tell him to

64
00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:17.720
concede to me two more days of suspension, to give him the time to know what to do.

65
00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:24.120
So the Lord gives the priest a message through Louisa that he has two more days to make up

66
00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:27.520
his mind as to what he's going to do.

67
00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:33.520
Then the confessor left, leaving me all pierced as though filled with bitterness, and Jesus

68
00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:40.000
letting me hear his voice again told me, poor daughter, how they embit her you.

69
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.520
I feel my heart being lacerated in seeing you like this.

70
00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:51.360
And even in saying that he indicates his very personal love for Louisa, courage do not fear

71
00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:57.800
my daughter, and then remember that it is by the intervention of obedience that is the

72
00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:01.840
priest that you were suspended from this state.

73
00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:05.000
So the priests are involved absolutely with this.

74
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:11.800
So this is a struggle, in fact, between the church and the divine will.

75
00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:19.240
If now they, the priests, do not want it anymore, I will also let you obey.

76
00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:24.480
Is this not the nail that pierces you the most, not being able to obey?

77
00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.120
And Louisa said, yes.

78
00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:31.720
Well, then I have promised you that I will let you obey, therefore, I do not want you

79
00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:34.160
to embit her yourself anymore.

80
00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:43.640
However, please tell them, do they want to play games with the Lord, woe to those who

81
00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:47.800
want to play games with the Lord and to fight against his will.

82
00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:53.980
So there's a warning shot across the bow, given to the priests, to start getting their

83
00:06:53.980 --> 00:07:00.320
act together with regard to Louisa and what the Lord is doing with her.

84
00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:03.400
And Louisa said, how can I go on without you?

85
00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:08.120
In fact, if I am not surprised by that state, I do not see you.

86
00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:14.720
And he said, since it is not your will to go out of this state of sacrifice, I will find

87
00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:20.620
other ways to make myself seen and to be with you, aren't you happy?

88
00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:26.280
So the following morning, without my losing consciousness, he made himself seen sensibly

89
00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:31.920
by giving me a few drops of milk to refresh me since my weakness was extreme.

90
00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:40.160
So this battle between the divine will and the human will of the priests, and therefore

91
00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:45.120
the struggle between Christ and his church.

92
00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:48.280
That doesn't limit God in any way.

93
00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:52.520
He can find ways and means to do what he wants.

94
00:07:52.520 --> 00:08:00.440
So November the 22nd, 1902, Louisa is about to die, and then the priest intervenes again,

95
00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:07.840
and he seems to be torturing Louisa without, I hope without realizing he's doing it.

96
00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:13.440
On November 22nd, as I kept feeling ill again, blessed Jesus came and he told me, my beloved

97
00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:16.760
dear one to come, that means to come to heaven.

98
00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:20.240
She said, yes, don't leave me on the earth any longer.

99
00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:24.120
And he said, yes, I want to content you once and for all.

100
00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:28.960
And as he was saying this, I felt my stomach and my throat close in such a way that nothing

101
00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:30.960
could enter anymore.

102
00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:34.880
I could barely pull a breath feeling suffocated.

103
00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:41.560
And then I saw that blessed Jesus called the angels and said to them, now that the victim

104
00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:47.600
is coming, suspend the fortresses so that the people may do what they want.

105
00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:53.360
In other words, now that the protection has been taken away, now that the victim's soul

106
00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:59.240
has been taken away, let all the chastisements come.

107
00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:05.200
And Louisa said, Lord, who are they?

108
00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:08.080
They are the angels that keep the cities.

109
00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:13.400
One of the things that the scriptures make clear to us is that first of all, we ourselves

110
00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:18.560
have an angel protecting us, families have angels, churches have angels, cities have

111
00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:21.840
angels, countries have angels.

112
00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:26.440
And the terrible battle between good and evil is going on between the good angels and the

113
00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:29.040
fallen angels all the time.

114
00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:36.520
And our actions and decisions put us on one side or the other side of that battle.

115
00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:41.640
He said, and you know when you go into the book of Revelation that it is the angels all

116
00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:46.800
the time that carry out the will of God and bring the chastisements to the earth because

117
00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:51.440
they're the ones that he's absolutely sure will, in fact, carry out his will.

118
00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:55.840
With us human beings, he never knows which side we're on.

119
00:09:55.840 --> 00:10:01.640
And we don't know half the time either because we change our minds so often.

120
00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:05.140
So Jesus said, they are the angels who keep the cities.

121
00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:10.840
As long as the cities are assisted by the fortress of divine protection.

122
00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:19.760
Now you really need to take real note of that, the fortress of divine protection.

123
00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:24.080
People just don't seem to be aware of this.

124
00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:31.560
If the cities are protected by the fortress of divine protection communicated to the angels,

125
00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.680
the enemy can do nothing.

126
00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:40.520
But if we sin and we sin sufficiently, then the protection will be taken away and that

127
00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:44.360
is the absolute worst punishment that can be given to us.

128
00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:52.520
Now if you go to the book of Ezekiel chapter 10 verses 18 to 22, you will see the divine

129
00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:56.760
protection being taken away from the people when the presence of the Lord rises up from

130
00:10:56.760 --> 00:11:02.040
the temple, hesitates because it is his home and leaves.

131
00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:07.760
But on that particular occasion, the people repented so he came back.

132
00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:15.000
But when the people had grievously sinned over 400 years, the Lord allowed the divine

133
00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:20.440
protection to be removed from the city of Jerusalem and from the people and their enemies, the

134
00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:27.200
Babylonians came in and conquered them and took them all into slavery.

135
00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:33.000
So as long as that fortress of divine protection is there, the enemy can do nothing.

136
00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:37.800
But once this protection is removed due to the grave sins that they commit and they are

137
00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:44.600
left on their own, they can make revolution and all sorts of evil.

138
00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:50.400
Unfortunately unusually, Louisa said, I remained placid instead of getting upset and seeing

139
00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:56.040
myself alone with my dear Jesus and abandoned by all creatures.

140
00:11:56.040 --> 00:12:00.680
So everybody is gone, the priests are paying no attention, nothing she just has Jesus all

141
00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:01.880
by himself.

142
00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:06.720
I thank the Lord from my heart and I prayed him to Dane not to let anyone come to me to

143
00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:07.720
bother me.

144
00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:14.320
She wanted to be alone with the alone, that's called solitude.

145
00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:19.840
And while I was in this position, my sister came and seeing me ill, she sent for the confessor

146
00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:25.480
who managed by force of obedience to have me open my throat a little bit.

147
00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:32.000
And then he came out giving me the obedience not to die.

148
00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:37.640
So I want to give you the book of Sirek chapter two, you really need the whole of the chapter

149
00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:41.480
because the priests are torturing Louisa.

150
00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:45.480
On the one hand, they won't cooperate with what the Lord wants to do and on the other

151
00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:50.080
hand, they give her this awful obedience not to die.

152
00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:56.360
And so she is literally emotionally and physically and spiritually tortured.

153
00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:59.560
It's really frightening what they're doing.

154
00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:05.120
But if you go to the book of Sirek and I won't give you the whole quotation, it says, my son,

155
00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:09.960
if you desire to serve the Lord, prepare yourself for an ordeal.

156
00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:15.040
And then it jumps down halfway down the page, it says, for gold is tested in the fire and

157
00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:19.320
chosen men are tested in the furnace of humiliation.

158
00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:21.920
So cling to the Lord and do not leave him.

159
00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:28.440
It's a wonderful chapter and will help you to understand what's going on here.

160
00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:31.720
So now she has the obedience not to die.

161
00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:36.600
She said, poor is the one who has to deal with human beings.

162
00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:41.720
Not only the depth of all the pains and torments of a soul, they add greater sorrows to her

163
00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:49.000
pains and it's easier to obtain compassion, help and relief from God than from human beings.

164
00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:53.720
Rather it seems that they get more excited.

165
00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:58.520
And may the Lord be always blessed who disposes everything for his glory and the good of souls.

166
00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:04.280
There's Louisa absolutely surrendered to the divine will even though she's literally

167
00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:08.200
being tortured by the priests.

168
00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:15.680
So November the 30th, 1902, this is about discernment.

169
00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:20.600
As I was amid fears, doubts, agitations that everything might be the work of the devil.

170
00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:28.640
Oncoming my adorable Jesus told me, my daughter, I am the son and I feel the whole world with

171
00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:29.640
light.

172
00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:34.640
That's one John, one, five, God is light in him, there is no darkness.

173
00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:39.400
And John ate twelve, I am the light of the world.

174
00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.600
So I feel the world with light.

175
00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:47.880
And as I go to a soul, another son, small is reproduced in her.

176
00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:54.440
In such a way that by dint of rays of light, they dart through each other continuously.

177
00:14:54.440 --> 00:15:01.960
So he comes to us, the light comes into us, and when we respond, light returns to him.

178
00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:09.760
Now between the two sons, clouds are formed, which are mortifications, humiliations, adversities,

179
00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.680
sufferings, and other things.

180
00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:16.440
Now I would have taught that the list was long enough without any other things.

181
00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:25.360
The clouds are mortifications, humiliations, adversities, sufferings, and other things.

182
00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:29.600
I don't know about you, but I am not really interested in the other things.

183
00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:36.160
If they are true sons, they have so much power that by darting through each other continuously,

184
00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:41.680
they triumph over these clouds and convert them into light.

185
00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:48.000
Now in this whole divine will spirituality, what the Lord is doing is trying to convert

186
00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:55.080
everything in us into light, because God is light, and at the moment of death light should

187
00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:57.960
meet light.

188
00:15:57.960 --> 00:16:04.080
God is love, and he tries to transform everything in us into love, so at the moment of death

189
00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:07.880
love meets love.

190
00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:14.720
And he wants our will to be completely and totally surrendered and given over into his

191
00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:21.120
will, so that at the moment of death, our will and his will meet as one.

192
00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.800
That's his plan.

193
00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:29.040
So I want to give you Romans 12-21 there.

194
00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:37.800
If though these mortifications and humiliations and so on are just apparent and false sons,

195
00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:42.840
the clouds which form between them have the strength to convert these sons into darkness.

196
00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:50.040
So it's our choice by responding to the Lord whether everything we experience is turned

197
00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:54.120
into light or the opposite, because there's only light and darkness.

198
00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:57.960
There isn't a gray area in between.

199
00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:04.360
This is the surest sign by which you can know whether it is I or the devil that's operating

200
00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:12.920
in you, whether everything in you is being gradually turned into light, gradually spiritualized,

201
00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:17.280
gradually divinized, gradually turned into love.

202
00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:20.120
This is the surest sign Jesus said.

203
00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:24.040
And one of the lovely things in these early volumes is he gives you all this discernment,

204
00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:32.360
so you can find out whether what is going on inside of you is real or not.

