00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:03.800
However, I do not lose heart, on the contrary, I hope that the mercy of the Lord may want

211
00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:08.600
to have compassion on this poor creature."

212
00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:16.200
So December the 3rd, 1902, Louisa gets disturbed about everything that's going on.

213
00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:21.480
This morning as I was in my usual state and my fears continued, when blessed Jesus came

