00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:29.880
I said to him, "Life of my life, how come you do not let me obey the order of my superiors?"

215
00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:34.200
Now when she says my superiors, she doesn't just mean the priests, she means the bishop

